OL,11,     Fmarriage to Laurence and refuses
OL,12,     Fto see him or allow him into their
OL,13,     Fflat. Laurence bribes Bea into
OL,14,     Finviting him to Jane's forthcoming
OL,15,     FNew Year's Eve party.
